+-- Why: process_return() restocks returned goods for a 'refund'
+-- resolution (same as 'restock'), but nothing anywhere records how
+-- much money was actually refunded to the customer. That meant the
+-- P&L (useProfitLoss / useMonthlyFinancials) kept counting the
+-- original sale as revenue in full even after it was refunded,
+-- overstating gross profit and net profit for any month with refunds.
